rion gives $u_{lm}\\in D(A_l)$ and $A_lu_{lm}=(\\mathcal UC\\psi)_{lm}$. The latter images are square summable; hence $C\\subseteq\\mathcal U^*\\widehat A\\mathcal U$. Both sides are self-adjoint, so equality follows by adjoints. This proves the exact block/domain identity under CC, also at $\\gamma=0$, without borrowing the AC-bearing endpoint theorem.",
